00:04:41,140 --> 00:04:45,610
A primary coil is powered by an AC voltage and create a magnetic field.

56
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:51,430
The magnetic field induces a current in the secondary coil in the contact.

57
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:53,140
The case of contactless cards.

