59
00:05:01,420 --> 00:05:07,900
hence create a magnetic field, which is this one with a 1356 carrier.

60
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:11,230
1350 six megahertz carrier frequency.

61
00:05:11,260 --> 00:05:18,490
This magnetic field is not constrained in a confined volume, as it would be the case in an actual transformer.

62
00:05:19,030 --> 00:05:27,100
Instead, the field flows virtually freely within a part of the open air, limited only by the directivity

63
00:05:27,100 --> 00:05:30,010
of the coil and the decrease of the magnetic waves.

